# Cenotaph — build artifacts & local-only files

# Build outputs
/build/
*.o
*.obj

# Final linked binaries (rebuild with `make`)
cenotaph.exe
cenotaph-debug.exe

# Packed beacon payload — NEVER commit. Cenotaph reads this as <exe-stem>.dat
# at runtime; it is built from the NaX fork and staged on the target.
*.dat
nax.x64.bin
*.bin

# Local test payloads / scratch
*.bin.bak
*.dat.bak
/test/
/scratch/

# Real generated keys (CenKey.h ships as a placeholder all-zero key so the repo
# builds out of the box; `make key` overwrites it with an obfuscated real key
# before staging. If you ever generate a real CenKey.h locally and want to be
# absolutely sure it cannot be committed, uncomment the next line.)
# include/CenKey.h

# Local development / design-history log — not part of the published tool doc
docs/development.md

# Editor / OS cruft
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.cache/